    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DDR is a third person action and fantasy game where you'll choose your warrior between more than 150 characters and enter in the battle or ride your Dragon to defeat hordes of enemies and conquer the fortresses in this action game in a single or multiplayer match!<br><br><strong><u>Use your voice to cast spells and to give to your dragon the order to split fire!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The magic world of Entelos is devasted by a great war that involves all the races and all the kingdoms, some of them follow the Dark King and his Dark Alliance in order to get the magic power and domain all, on the other side the free kingdoms try to resist to the power of this evil adunance. These two factions, at this time of the war, have a main objective: conquer and control the Towers of magic power where little pieces of the arcane magic power were hidden. You are one of the warriors of one of these factions and with your companions you'll conquer these magic fortress to get the power and decide the sort of the war!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DDR is a third person action and fantasy game where you'll choose your warrior between more than 150 characters and enter in the battle or ride your Dragon to defeat hordes of enemies and conquer the fortresses in this action game in a single or multiplayer match!<br><br><strong><u>Use your voice to cast spells and to give to your dragon the order to split fire!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The magic world of Entelos is devasted by a great war that involves all the races and all the kingdoms, some of them follow the Dark King and his Dark Alliance in order to get the magic power and domain all, on the other side the free kingdoms try to resist to the power of this evil adunance. These two factions, at this time of the war, have a main objective: conquer and control the Towers of magic power where little pieces of the arcane magic power were hidden. You are one of the warriors of one of these factions and with your companions you'll conquer these magic fortress to get the power and decide the sort of the war!</p>",
    "short_description": "Choose your warrior between more than 150 characters and enter in the battle or ride your Dragon to defeat enemies hordes and conquer the fortresses in this action game in a single or multiplayer match!",
